  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 104.59 Wetland permit planning tool (WPPT)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 104.59 “Wetland permit planning tool (WPPT)” means a geographic information systems tool that provides access to data for planning projects near or in jurisdictional areas, available at https://nhdeswppt.unh.edu.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1, #2, #3, and #4 at Chapter heading for Env-Wt 100) #12801, eff 12-15-19; renumbered by #13945 (formerly Env-Wt 104.58)",
